{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/extras/933584317654b0c44daea9c964c4d230.avif?t=1771777156\" width=1560 height=634 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Retrieve the Stone of Life with the power of shadow clones!</strong> <br>  <br>Take control of the young ninja Hiko and his shadow clones to solve puzzles, defeat enemies, and save the village from the sinister monk Doku. <br>In a distant bamboo village lies the Stone of Life - a source of strength and prosperity. When the monk Doku steals it, Hiko embarks on a daring journey to reclaim what was taken and restore peace.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/extras/e65c6c389d2d519d2b3e452900b9f3cf.poster.avif?t=1771777156\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/extras/e65c6c389d2d519d2b3e452900b9f3cf.webm?t=1771777156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/extras/e65c6c389d2d519d2b3e452900b9f3cf.mp4?t=1771777156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Ninjora Echoes</strong></i> is a 2D platformer where the core mechanic is creating and controlling shadow clones. You won\u2019t just fight and jump - you\u2019ll carefully plan your every move. Clones help you activate buttons, hold down switches, and distract enemies, opening up new paths through the levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/extras/20a6ac3d802fe4e74db5cde55d0cb05f.poster.avif?t=1771777156\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/extras/20a6ac3d802fe4e74db5cde55d0cb05f.webm?t=1771777156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/extras/20a6ac3d802fe4e74db5cde55d0cb05f.mp4?t=1771777156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiko\u2019s ability to transfer his soul into any of his clones allows you to control multiple characters at once, coordinate their actions, and overcome complex puzzles where every shadow matters. Use clones to build vertical towers, reach inaccessible platforms, and bypass deadly traps. Combat blends with tactical elements: throw shurikens, engage in melee, and unleash ninja skills to overcome your foes. Each level is a true test of both wits and reflexes, while battles with powerful bosses - including Doku himself - demand mastery and strategic thinking.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/extras/4bf1930ad544aa73fa4b1e049d46f325.poster.avif?t=1771777156\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/extras/4bf1930ad544aa73fa4b1e049d46f325.webm?t=1771777156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/extras/4bf1930ad544aa73fa4b1e049d46f325.mp4?t=1771777156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of shadow clones, combine cunning and agility, and reclaim the Stone of Life to save your village!<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and control shadow clones with soul relocation mechanics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique mix of platforming, puzzle-solving, and dynamic combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helpful companions: Pochi the dog with useful tips, and Frogus the upgrade merchant. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense boss battles, including the final showdown against Doku.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003290?t=1771777156","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/11faf08128c7b324da746062aa7a1dc48b6f12c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771777156","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/75d5407756bab069414b96f0cf5b48492f3585cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771777156","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/75d5407756bab069414b96f0cf5b48492f3585cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771777156","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4131880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/extras/933584317654b0c44daea9c964c4d230.avif?t=1771777156\" width=1560 height=634 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Retrieve the Stone of Life with the power of shadow clones!</strong> <br>  <br>Take control of the young ninja Hiko and his shadow clones to solve puzzles, defeat enemies, and save the village from the sinister monk Doku. <br>In a distant bamboo village lies the Stone of Life - a source of strength and prosperity. When the monk Doku steals it, Hiko embarks on a daring journey to reclaim what was taken and restore peace.  <br>  <