nleash ninja skills to overcome your foes. Each level is a true test of both wits and reflexes, while battles with powerful bosses - including Doku himself - demand mastery and strategic thinking.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/extras/4bf1930ad544aa73fa4b1e049d46f325.poster.avif?t=1771777156\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/extras/4bf1930ad544aa73fa4b1e049d46f325.webm?t=1771777156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/extras/4bf1930ad544aa73fa4b1e049d46f325.mp4?t=1771777156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of shadow clones, combine cunning and agility, and reclaim the Stone of Life to save your village!<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and control shadow clones with soul relocation mechanics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique mix of platforming, puzzle-solving, and dynamic combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helpful companions: Pochi the dog with useful tips, and Frogus the upgrade merchant. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense boss battles, including the final showdown against Doku.</p></li></ul>","developers":["BUG-Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003290/34b76aeb586eb05c559a7b5fbe00522df64f0e06/header.jpg?t=1771777156","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 \u00a9 Ratalaika Games S.L. All rights reserved. All other trademarks and copyrights are the properties of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<